		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Streaming verification\n\nA manual trigger drives ONE model call directly through the governed chat model (no agent loop needed): the Basic LLM Chain exercises the model's streaming path (astream/_stream -> POST /governed/llm-chat-stream).\n\nAcceptance:\n1. the node answers (content from the governed call);\n2. gateway log shows the llm-chat-stream endpoint hit;\n3. if the endpoint fell back to non-streaming, the node STILL answers -- check the gateway log to distinguish.\n\nRequires: research client in the registry (scripts/dev-gateway.sh)."
			},
			"id": "cccc0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
			"name": "Sticky Note",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [-560, -240]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {},
